  "contracts_reviewed": [
    "Portable fresh/own-save plans bind the exact source, image, input and parent checkpoint; the owner controls only its nonce-bound container on an existing local engine.",
    "One uncertain stop command is followed by a read-only inspection of the exact owned ID. A confirmed stopped container does not erase the failed command or cause a model, input or stop retry.",
    "Source-bound image packaging exports a standalone clean checkout and explicit generated bindings without changing the base runtime or using host provider credentials. Context verification is not image-build/native proof.",
    "Versioned failure reconciliation retains original private evidence, model usage and memory and never repeats input or inference. Restart paths preserve all earlier discontinuities and leave incomplete native loss unknown.",
    "Save-boundary audits bind parent lineage, paused calendar, native receipts, token accounting and trace prefixes. A saved final checkpoint is not automatically a fresh reload or proof of sustainable gameplay.",
    "Screen-only observation and explicit versioned prompts retain the selected keyboard profile without giving the model private evaluator state. Catalog review covers profile selection and literal source contents, not a new upstream/runtime key compatibility audit.",
    "Optional host-process identity capture cannot prevent gameplay. Spectator follow binds PID/start/command identity and expires on observation uncertainty; actual native live-follow acceptance remains unverified.",
    "The spectator exposes only projected screen/actions, not private model memory or transcripts. A live chosen action is not execution proof; the saved exporter binds the audited native trace.",
    "The currently supported portable recording audit is explicitly the historical two-VM acceptance schema, not a general run-audit generator for another engine.",
    "Comparison readers bind indexed declarations and public results, retain every declared slot, preserve unknown costs/metrics and distinguish failed infrastructure from absent publication. They do not verify the underlying native game or support a strong ranking.",
    "Matched own-save/endurance preparation retains the parent result chain, model conditions, saved memory/usage contract and declared segment/budget boundaries. Configuration output neither launches gameplay nor expands spending authority."
  ],
